Cell[CellGroupData[{Cell[BoxData[InterpretationBox[Cell["\t", "ExampleDelimiter"], $Line = 0; Null]], "ExampleDelimiter"], Cell["Search an XMLObject document:", "ExampleText"], Cell[BoxData["tree=ImportString[\"<article><h1>Menu</h1><ul><li><a href=\\\"/miso\\\">Miso</a></li><li><a href=\\\"/pho\\\">Pho</a></li></ul></article>\",{\"HTML\",\"XMLObject\"}];
