Cell[CellGroupData[{Cell[BoxData[InterpretationBox[Cell["\t", "ExampleDelimiter"], $Line = 0; Null]], "ExampleDelimiter"], Cell["Give two equal values at different places as two results:", "ExampleText"], Cell[BoxData["hrefs=ImportString[\"<p><a href=\\\"/x\\\">one</a><a href=\\\"/x\\\">two</a></p>\",{\"HTML\",\"XMLObject\"}];
